# This is the only translation file in your volume — it has the highest priority.
# The bot's built-in translations live in the image (assets.default/) and are always up to date;
# bot updates don't touch them, and this file remains yours.

# This file serves two purposes:
#
# 1. Overriding built-in translations.
#    To change any standard key — copy it here with your own text.
#    The value here overrides the built-in one (assets.default/), the remaining keys are taken from the bot.
#
# 2. Custom translations that are not in the standard set.
#    For example: additional menu buttons, plan names, etc.
#    Use the key instead of the text (for example, in a plan name).
#    To avoid clashing with built-in keys, give them a custom- prefix.

# Keys must be unique. Detailed documentation on translations: assets/README.md.

# Maximum translation length:
# For use in buttons — 32 characters.
# For use in messages — 1024 characters.

# example-key = translation

custom-menu-link1 = 1️⃣ First button
custom-menu-link2 = 2️⃣ Second button

custom-plan-name1 = 1️⃣ First plan
custom-plan-name2 = 2️⃣ Second plan